{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "ブログを開いていただき、"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ありがとうございます！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "埼玉県出身のえんどうりこです。☺︎"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "リアルミート&グリート"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "足を運んでくださった皆さん、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ありがとうございました！！"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202607/mobBaMrZA.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202607/mob4cpNYb.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202607/mobWuPF57.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202607/mobNfHSnt.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "浴衣を着ました🍧"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "また三期生みんなで浴衣を着ることができて嬉しかった☺︎"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202607/mobgzz67L.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202607/mobOE9DjD.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "むかいしもりで着付けてくれたんだ〜。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ほんとにいつもありがとう😭"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "2人のコンビネーションの良さに感動してしまう、、、、！！"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202607/mob6OMn8S.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202607/moboIzQ1a.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "🫶"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202607/mobOcqSeb.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "このみん☺︎"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ヘアアクセサリーも浴衣にぴったりで可愛かったな〜。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "センス抜群だ🙂‍↕️"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202607/mobPgBvza.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ほのさんに話しかけに行く時、"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "にやけが止まらなくなっている気がします。笑"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202607/mobG3MkRL.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "じーっ。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "お肌も白くてかわいくて、"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "白うさぎさんがぴったり！！！🐰"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "最近大園さんと喋る時は大園さんっぽいことを言えるように意識してみてるんだ〜。🤫笑"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202607/mobjqjWGW.png", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "祝花もありがとうございます！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "みんなそれぞれテーマを決めてデザインしてくれたり、"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "メッセージも書いてくれていたり、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "本当に愛に溢れるお花たちで嬉しすぎるよ〜。幸せでした！！"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202607/mobOB056U.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "まだまだ夏は始まったばかりですが、"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "夏の思い出沢山増やしていきましょ！🙌🍉"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "櫻坂チャンネルで朝活Vlogが公開されてるのでぜひみてね〜。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "https://youtu.be/ci4m7HdJQUg"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202607/mobv1mH1c.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "サムネがオシャレだ〜！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "みんなは朝型派？夜型派？"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ちなみに私は朝型派かと思いきや、"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "多分どっちでも行けるタイプです。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "最後まで読んでいただき、"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ありがとうございました！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今日のブログはここまで〜。"}], "source": "official"}